# Default Branch And Run Mode

- Default working branch is `develop`.
- On "run project" requests, use development mode by default (`npm run dev:all` or `npm start`).
- Do not switch to `main`/production unless user explicitly asks for production/live.
- If currently on a non-dev branch and user did not request otherwise, switch back to `develop` before continuing.
- Production actions must be explicit: "switch to production", "deploy live", or similar.
- After production/hotfix tasks, return to `develop` unless user asks to stay.

